`firmware/nspanel-v92-blank.tft` and `firmware/nspanel-v92-blank-base.tft`
contain the Nextion display runtime and the NSPanel display configuration.
They are provided for use with genuine NSPanel hardware only. The TFT is a
modified build of the blank UI exported with Nextion Editor 1.65.1, patched with
the V92 terminal loader. No personal or site-specific UI content is included.

The native display source in `firmware/src/` is original project code and is
provided under the repository's MIT license. It calls fixed routines in the
stock runtime; no vendor source code is included.

The ESPHome component is derived from ESPHome's public component interfaces and
retains the upstream MIT licensing terms where applicable.
